        // are a dashed line (three or more; every gap within 0.4 .. 2.2 times the median gap plus 2 px; every dash within 0.4 ..
        // 2.5 times the median dash plus 2 px), with the median dash in cell 0 of `s1` afterwards; 0 when not.
